Vendored LingBot-VA files (wan_va/):
  wan_va/modules/__init__.py, wan_va/modules/utils.py, wan_va/utils/scheduler.py
    unchanged;
  wan_va/__init__.py, wan_va/utils/__init__.py, wan_va/modules/model.py
    modified, as stated at the top of each of these files.
arm_opsd/sft_only/flow_matching.py and arm_opsd/sft_only/episodes.py reimplement the joint flow-matching
loss and the LIBERO sample preparation of LingBot-VA (wan_va/train.py, wan_va/dataset/) for the SFT-only
variant. The upstream websocket inference server, training script, dataset classes, RoboTwin/Franka
examples, configuration files and papers are not included.

Everything else in this directory is new code of WAM-Policy, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

